BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 669.77 Tm (The most expensive trap is partnering with an operator that disappears. Levon Nikoghosyan warns that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 654.55 Tm (scam brands drain affiliates within 6 to 12 months, even as spend campaigns and upfront, listing, and) Tj ET
