BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.10 Tm (practitioner gives the screening rule: check how long the operator has been live and confirm with other) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 608.87 Tm (affiliates, because brands running only a couple of months can vanish [ohEZ5-gHckQ @ 00:12:00]. A) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 593.65 Tm (second red flag is the operator who says 'we work worldwide' with no defined GEO; those brands pay listing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.42 Tm (fees, fail to convert, and end up delisted [JCr5X66vWg4 @ 00:15:02]. Paul, CMO of Mr Gamble, runs the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.20 Tm (affiliate-side due diligence as a player would: licensed casinos only, test deposits and landing pages) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 547.97 Tm (personally, search forums for late-payment complaints, and demand localized payments, with Canada minus) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 532.75 Tm (Interac treated as a flat no-go [R-_FHgwDEFQ @ 00:12:03]. Paul also asks operators for their top ten GEOs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 517.52 Tm (and conversion numbers and benchmarks them against the wider casino set before listing anything. Every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.30 Tm (one of these checks costs hours; skipping them is how affiliates end up inside Levon's 6-to-12-month drain.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.07 Tm (The economics checks are blunt. Levon Nikoghosyan says an affiliate that fails to segment traffic by GEO,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 471.85 Tm (separating Morocco, the US, and LatAm, ends up instead of earning 100K a month, earning like ten K and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 456.62 Tm (burning the other 90K [ohEZ5-gHckQ @ 00:20:12]. Michael Daly exposes a margin trap inside Catena) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.40 Tm (Media's own books: sport delivered 28% of revenue but only 9% of EBITDA, the company had) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.17 Tm (under-invested in sport, and casino carries the higher lifetime value [DmXIrgbAw-Y @ 00:27:02]. Daly also) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 410.95 Tm (calls paid search low-margin and best avoided by affiliates, with organic SEO plus content coming first. On) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 395.72 Tm (the publishing side, Christian Strutt warns that showing a bonus in a state where it is not offered will just) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 380.50 Tm (completely kill it, so every state page needs its own promo codes and geo-targeting so only licensed books) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.27 Tm (appear [MKTk-Y-xt1I @ 00:04:46]. Operators burn money too: Levon says spending 10K to 20K on listings) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.05 Tm (is wasted without traffic relevance [ohEZ5-gHckQ @ 00:16:36]. The common thread is that headline volume) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 334.82 Tm (hides the leak, whether the leak is an unsegmented GEO, a low-margin vertical, a mismatched state bonus,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 319.60 Tm (or a listing fee paid to the wrong audience.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.37 Tm (Regulatory reversals wipe out whole books overnight. Levon Nikoghosyan calls the Brazil ban a business) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.15 Tm (killer: an SEO site with 10,000 players a day has no legal outlet, rerouting that traffic risks jail, and switching) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 273.92 Tm (players to gray brands will also be banned, while Brazil-only operators shut down [JCr5X66vWg4 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 258.70 Tm (00:27:51]. When the Curacao files broke, brands stripped license details from their footers within a day) Tj ET
